"className":"font-display text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-[0.02em] text-white mb-5","children":"What Is the Law of Assumption? A Beginner's Guide"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body italic text-grey-DEFAULT text-lg leading-relaxed","children":"The Law of Assumption is not the Law of Attraction. It doesn't ask you to think positive thoughts and wait. It asks you to assume — to inhabit the state of the wish already fulfilled."}]]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 px-6 md:px-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl mx-auto","children":[["$","h2","0",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Law of Attraction vs. The Law of Assumption"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Most people come to Neville Goddard through the Law of Attraction. They've tried vision boards, gratitude journals, and positive affirmations. Some things worked. Most didn't. And the inconsistency was maddening."]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Neville's teaching is different at the root level. The Law of Attraction says: *think about what you want and it will come to you.* The Law of Assumption says: *assume you already have it, and reality will rearrange itself to confirm that assumption.*"]}],["$","p","3",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The distinction sounds subtle. It is not."]}],["$","h2","4",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"What \"Assumption\" Actually Means"}],["$","p","5",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["To assume, in Neville's framework, is to occupy a state. Not to pretend. Not to lie to yourself. But to step into the consciousness of a person who already has what you desire — and ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"feel from that place."}],""]}],["$","p","6",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Imagine you've just received the news that you got the job. Or that the relationship is healed. Or that the money arrived. How does that *feel* in your body? That feeling — that specific inner tone — is the assumption. And according to Neville, that feeling is a cause, not an effect."]}],["$","blockquote","7",{"className":"border-l-2 border-orange-DEFAULT pl-6 my-8 font-body italic text-grey-DEFAULT text-lg leading-relaxed","children":"*\"Assume the feeling of your wish fulfilled and observe the route that your attention follows.\"* — Neville Goddard"}],["$","h2","8",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Why Most People Fail"}],["$","p","9",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The most common mistake is \"thinking of\" rather than \"thinking from.\" You think *about* the desired outcome as something distant, something to be obtained. But Neville teaches that you must think *from* the state — as if it is already done."]}],["$","p","10",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["This is not semantics. It rewires the instruction being sent to the subconscious."]}],["$","p","11",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["When you think *of* something, your subconscious registers lack. When you think *from* it — as a living reality — your subconscious registers fulfillment and begins filtering the world for evidence to confirm it."]}],["$","h2","12",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Role of Your Brain"}],["$","p","13",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Neuroscience gives us a framework to understand why this works. Your Reticular Activating System (RAS) — a network in the brainstem — filters approximately 11 million bits of incoming data per second, allowing only 50 into conscious awareness. It filters for what you've told it is important."]}],["$","p","14",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["When you deeply assume a state — emotionally, not just intellectually — you reprogram the RAS to select for evidence of that state in the world around you. Opportunities appear. Coincidences multiply. The \"bridge of incidents\" forms."]}],["$","h2","15",{"className":"font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"How to Begin"}],["$","ol","16",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-orange-DEFAULT text-sm flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5","children":["01","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"**Identify the specific desire.** Not a vague wish, but a precise outcome."}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-orange-DEFAULT text-sm flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5","children":["02","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"**Create a brief scene** that implies the wish fulfilled — a single moment *after* the desire has manifested."}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-orange-DEFAULT text-sm flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5","children":["03","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"**Inhabit the feeling** of that scene nightly, especially in the state akin to sleep (SATS)."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-orange-DEFAULT text-sm flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5","children":["04","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"**Persist.** Current reality is an echo of past thoughts. Stay faithful to the assumption even when 3D shows no confirmation."}]]}]]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The Law of Assumption is not a technique. It is an understanding of how consciousness creates reality. And once you've seen it work — even once — the world never looks the same again."]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"px-6 md:px-14 pb-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl mx-auto","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-black-2 border-2 border-orange-DEFAULT p-8 md:p-12 text-center","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":20,"height":20,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-crown text-orange-DEFAULT mx-auto mb-4","children":[["$","path","1vdc57",{"d":"M11.562 3.266a.5.5 0 0 1 .876 0L15.39 8.87a1 1 0 0 0 1.516.294L21.183 5.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .798.519l-2.834 10.246a1 1 0 0 1-.956.734H5.81a1 1 0 0 1-.957-.734L2.02 6.02a.5.5 0 0 1 .798-.519l4.276 3.664a1 1 0 0 0 1.516-.294z"}],["$","path","11awu3",{"d":"M5 21h14"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[0.55rem] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-orange-DEFAULT mb-3","children":"Ready to Apply This?"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white mb-4 tracking-widest","children":"START BUILDING YOUR REALITY"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body italic text-grey-DEFAULT mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed","children":"Join Vibe Hyr free and access Course 01, the nightly Revision Journal, and the Assumption Lab."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":